<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Spie Batignolles deal -source.</title>
<headline>EU clears Spie Batignolles deal -source.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has cleared the acquisition of French construction firm Spie Batignolles SA by Financiere Spie Batignolles SCA and Amec Plc, a British construction and engineering group, a European Union source said on Friday.</p>
<p>Spie Batignolles is currently a unit of diversified engineering group Schneider SA.</p>
<p>The deal was notified for clearance under the EU's merger rules on January 3.</p>
</text>
